1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,527
Tap Add case on the Home screen.

2
00:00:03,577 --> 00:00:08,766
Have the CNR? Type it here. Or scan the QR code on an order.

3
00:00:08,816 --> 00:00:17,644
Tap Fetch, then type the eCourts captcha.

4
00:00:17,694 --> 00:00:27,832
The court, parties and next date fill in by themselves.

5
00:00:27,882 --> 00:00:32,097
Check the details and tap Save case.

6
00:00:32,147 --> 00:00:36,783
The case is in your diary, with its next date.
